# Data pipeline & deployment

## Airflow (`dags/scrapers_dag.py`)

- Schedule: daily 02:00
- Image: `nuoto-scrapers:latest`
- Parallel: `scrape_ficr` (current year)
- Sequential: federnuoto → federnuoto_master → federnuoto_records (past season)
- Then: `aggregate` with `-redis-addr redis:6379` on `nuoto-scraper` network

## Docker

- `Dockerfile.scrapers` — ficr, federnuoto, aggregator binaries
- `Dockerfile.backend` — Go API
- `Dockerfile.frontend-v5` — nginx + static SPA
- `compose.nuoto.yml` — Traefik + Redis + backend + one frontend profile (v1–v5)

## Env vars

OAuth and JWT: see [AUTH.md](../../AUTH.md). Never commit secrets.

## Data mounts

Scraped/aggregated dirs are bind-mounted from the host; not in git.
